   "source": [
    "## Q3.1: Unique users per country (currency)\n",
    "\n",
    "Grouped by `currency` and counted distinct `user_url` values (not transaction rows) to get\n",
    "unique users per country-proxy. Plotted the top 20 currencies by unique user count, since the\n",
    "full currency list has a long tail of rare/one-off values that would make a full plot unreadable.\n",
    "Note: this is an approximation — a user could appear under more than one currency due to travel\n",
    "or a misconfigured currency setting (as flagged earlier for some SA users showing $ instead of R)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "id": "949f485b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
