   "source": [
    "## Q4.2.2: Detecting missed fill-up logs\n",
    "\n",
    "Rule: for consecutive fill-ups by the same user (sorted by date_fueled), compare the actual\n",
    "odometer increase to the miles value logged on the later entry. If odometer_diff > 1.5 x miles,\n",
    "at least one fill-up was likely missed in between (the car travelled meaningfully further than\n",
    "one tank's worth of driving). Odometer jumps outside [0, 5000] miles are excluded as likely\n",
    "residual bad odometer data rather than genuine large gaps. [Add your actual counts/percentage\n",
    "here once run.]"
   ]
  },
